          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Captivating sea is a restricted region of Jade Pool blessed land. A demonic path Gu Immortal who spoke of the place had omitted groundmat grass and purple poisonous heart flowers. Fang Yuan treats these hazards as minor inconveniences. Fairy Li Shan calls them small problems for Gu Immortals; peach wolves dwell in the illusory peach tree forest, and Miniscule Mountain lies in the depths of captivating sea.",
